    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "body",
      "narration_text": "But the whole toolkit rests on one asymmetry. Claude cannot watch the video. It has never sat in the audience. It can't tell whether a joke lands, or whether an idea clicked. Taste isn't a step it does slowly. It's a step it can't do at all.",
